{"v":4,"catch":"歡迎來到「神秘盒子」系列的新篇章。","desc":"你被困在黑暗的房間裡，必須解決有趣的謎題才能打開盒子並逃脫。 \n你能做到嗎？ \n\n與奇異的機制互動，跳脫框架思考以獲得自由，並發現歷史未解之謎。 \n在玩這個益智遊戲時，您將體驗到現實生活中的冒險！ \n許多有趣的謎題正在等著您，確保您獲得身臨其境的體驗，讓您沉浸其中幾個小時。 \n檢查多種機制來解鎖每個盒子並獲得自由。","publisher":"Ocean Media","release":"2023-12-21","genres":["益智","桌上遊戲"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文","俄文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.7GB / Switch 0.7GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2b0b4ca17be11019f4750e9eb41fe6a49889ff3f47e73d4b5a9643f2a74c6293.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9791095382f50f03f8dcc49d6d77db1bcdaf98beb76628d25b3f14dcab29564f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/99186f420b72f783a1d0ebd0a8b2f7e26b015c824773e9099891ab2e028c9f42.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/924c8f68fff63cc30d9dcbb90184be40b764e1de5c3c37d2bd6225bd989798d3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c2c96ce36dd7631722d046dcec3b32be70cc4d44ddabd5d720d4224001be2ede.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fedaddbf280eba651cf454d1036223672e16d4c2007ca528ba82c266c2600fc4.jpg"],"titleId":"0100e7201dce4000","dlc":[]}